WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
<v Wren Halloway>Welcome to the Lamplight Workshop. I'm Wren.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Osric Penhale>And I'm Osric. Today we rewire the lamp that started all of this.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:16.000
<v Wren Halloway>Rule one: unplug it, and do not try it out first. That cord is cracked.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:52.000
<v Osric Penhale>We picked a cloth-covered cord with a polarized plug. The ribbed side goes to the shell.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:36.000
<v Wren Halloway>Plugging in. And there it is. First light.
